# Build CRYO Enterprise ERP 2.0 – Complete Application

Act as a senior full-stack developer, ERP solution architect, UI/UX designer and business workflow specialist.

Build a complete, modern, responsive, functional and user-friendly ERP application named **CRYO Enterprise ERP 2.0**.

Use the attached `CRYO_ERP_Workflow.md` as the primary source of truth for all business workflows, department responsibilities, modules, screens, forms, document relationships, validations and status transitions.

Read and understand the entire document before starting implementation.

## 1. Main Objective

Build the entire ERP application, not just a dashboard, landing page, UI prototype or a few sample screens.

The application should manage the complete business lifecycle:

Customer Enquiry → Follow-up → Qualified Enquiry → Quotation → Negotiation / Revision → Proforma Invoice → Customer PO → Payment Entry → Sales Order → Production Order → Duration Planning → BOM Request → Supply Chain → Material Issue → Production → Daily Updates → Quality Check → Rework / Acceptance → Dispatch → Delivery Completion.

Every department must be fully connected.

The application should be extremely simple for non-technical employees to understand and operate.

Do not introduce unnecessary ERP complexity, unwanted modules, excessive form fields or complicated approval processes.

## 2. Application Modules

Build the following four main business departments:

1. Sales Management
2. Supply Chain Management
3. Production Management
4. Logistics & Delivery Management

Also implement common supporting modules:

