## 13. Business Workflow Automation

Implement a centralized workflow system.

Do not maintain separate conflicting statuses across departments.

Automatically synchronize the following:

- Accepted enquiry → Qualified Enquiries
- Accepted quotation → PI creation
- Confirmed sales order → Received Sales Orders in Production
- Submitted BOM → Supply Chain Material Requests
- Partial material issue → Production material status
- Full material issue and receipt → Ready to Start
- Manufacturing completed → Quality Check
- QC rejected → Rework
- Rework completed → Quality Check
- QC accepted → Ready for Dispatch
- Dispatch confirmed → Sales Order tracking update
- Delivery confirmed → Sales Order fulfillment completed

All status changes must be based on actual saved business transactions.

Do not simulate workflow completion by only changing a visual badge.

Every related screen must reflect the same underlying saved data.

